<title>USA: Galileo warns loss likely in fiscal 1997.</title>
<headline>Galileo warns loss likely in fiscal 1997.</headline>
<dateline>STURBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galileo Corp on Wednesday said it would likely suffer a loss in fiscal 1997 after losing Xerox as a customer for its dicorotron assemblies.</p>
<p>The Xerox business accounted for 48 percent of Galileo's fiscal 1996 revenues, or $20.4 million of its total sales of $42.6 million, the company said.</p>
